    Fix the stale REST doc for the health endpoint (#8049)
    
    health.json/health.xml claimed to return NO_CONTENT for a healthy
    system, but this has not been the case since the endpoint was written to
    count services by state instead: it always returns 200 with those counts
    as its body, e.g. {"health":{"healthy":82,"warning":0,"error":0}}.
    
